ge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、面倒な！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聴罪師直属衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聴罪師直属衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（サルカズ語）血の匂いが変わりました。聴罪師様は目的を果たし大君もまた勝利を手にしたようです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聴罪師直属衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（サルカズ語）撤退いたしましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聴罪師直属衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（サルカズ語）自由に動けぬ者は、私の指示に従い、短刀を胸に突き立てなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シージ","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貴様ら――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウィンダミア公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……うっ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"変形者","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……両腕の感覚が失われて、護衛たちも全滅した。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"変形者","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"君は今、どんな形をした感情を抱えているのかな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"変形者","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウィンダミア公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……ハァ……ハァ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウィンダミア公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"サルカズ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"変形者","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼は上手に隙を突いたね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"変形者","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あの時に君が見せた一瞬の綻び、狼狽に乗じて……でも、一体どうしてあんな隙を見せたの？　僕たちには理解できない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"変形者","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僕たちは……とても残念に思う。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウィンダミア公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ブラッドブルードの大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ブラッドブルードの大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"もはや命運